Output validation.gif

Require go

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Padding 24
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#674EFF"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "cd examples/validation" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "# Validation example: built-in validators plus custom checks" Sleep 700ms Enter
Sleep 900ms
Type "go run main.go" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 6s
